{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"The City (Manhattan)","id":"863371194371801118","name":"toyenbee-café","position":65,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":null,"type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I'm sure Meorys will do the same.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:40:25.086000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866600354153627678","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I literally watched you two die, just last week. I carted your bodies on the ferry. I'm not being silly this time, bud. Empire City's a killer.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:41:57.688000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866600742554566687","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"We'll survive, best we can.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:42:19.240000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866600832949813278","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Well we just have to not die harder.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:42:24.086000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866600853276327936","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"That we will cap, for sure.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:42:35.668000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866600901854101545","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"After a moment of silence, the nameless once again speaks up. \"So, what did the ravens ask from you? Do you remember?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:43:10.999000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866601050042662922","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I do. As well as Willow. She doesn't remember anymore, poor girl, but I was there when she paid her price. And we were together when we paid ours.\"\n\nIrynx's hand reaches up habitually to fidget with her antlers, only to find nothing there. \"Service. Disciples. They want to see others under the tenets of the Raven. I can be very persuasive.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:48:27.399000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866602377120972801","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"The nameless suddenly remembers him asking for the ravens' power and them replying he could get it. \"So this is what they meant\" he mutters quietly, it felt like so long ago, but it was just last week.\n\"So? Have you gotten disciples? I'm glad to help\" The nameless says genuinely. \"You've done so much for me, it's the least I can do.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:51:18.010000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866603092715241472","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"Irynx is taken aback. \"I don't really want you to do it for me. That feels, really inconsiderate to the ravens. And really reactive. Think about it first.\"\n\nShe smiles to herself. \"I'm the priestess of Thought. I say thinking is a requirement.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:54:06.617000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866603799904649226","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I don't mean to do your entire job cap'n. I can help in other ways. Maybe a newspaper article? Or just joining you in your missions, stuff like that.\"\nThe nameless smirks, \"I don't think I'd ever make a good priestess.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:56:04.785000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866604295536640000","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Oh... sorry, I misunderstood. I thought you were giving yourself up. Not that it's a bad thing. I know you had a bad experience with them, but they're not *monsters*.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:57:33.945000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866604669500129291","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Don't worry cap.\" The nameless suffers a blank expression. \"I won't repeat my mistakes again. I will never want to forget.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T08:59:03.530000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866605045248425994","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Forgetting can be good, sometimes. Willow's forgotten a horrible thing and I believe she'll be better for it.\" She purses. \"No offense meant but knowing you, I fully believe you went to them out of arrogance.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:01:06.142000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866605559518986240","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I very much forgot who I was before. But that is fair.\" The nameless smirks. He then think about how he has changed. For better or worse, he has. \"It was something about the clutter's case. Why I thought the ravens would be the first choice for something as petty as gold? I'm glad I no longer remember.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:03:52.621000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866606257783701535","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Next time you see them, thank them for me.\" He says as he lies on his back and starts fidgetting with his hands.","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:04:23.115000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866606385684676609","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"You and Meorys are like that.\" Irynx points out. \"You're young, so you'll grow out of it eventually. Treasure just becomes worthless sometimes. You live long enough, you learn just how quickly coin loses its value.\"\n\nShe flips a silver piece back into her hand. \"So you spend it while you have it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:06:48.463000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866606995318505482","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Meorys more than me.\" The nameless laughs.","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:09:52.671000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866607767941808128","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"True. Before we met, she and I found this birdhouse on the roof of the port. It chased after us but we both made it out okay.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:12:45.414000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866608492479774731","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I'm guessing she wanted to loot that birdhouse?\" The nameless says with a raised eyebrow.","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:13:36.692000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866608707554377739","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"The nest, actually. It was a mama bird.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:15:12.496000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866609109385609227","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Not the wierdest thing I've heard in Empire city.\" He then goes silent for a while. \"I think Meorys might not want to crew up with me cap.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:16:41.183000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866609481366241280","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"She squints. \"Did you do something to her?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:17:20.889000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866609647904096278","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"We had an encounter with werewolves in Hampstead. She got bit by a young lycan-born. She got mad and tried to slay it. I, and the others present, tried to stop her. I tried explaining to her how that would be a bad idea on so many levels, but she wasn't having it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:19:28.342000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866610182482034708","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I'm sorry if I ruined your crew cap. I could leave so that Meorys and you can still fly together.\" The nameless says slowly.","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:20:05.459000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866610338161098762","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I'd rather have you both. If she doesn't want to fly with us, then I'd rather have you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:23:03.740000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866611085926727690","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"The nameless sits up straight at his captain's words, his eyes glistening slightly. \"Why, thanks cap, appreciate it.\" He then proceeds to wipe his eyes with his sleeve. \"Don't worry I'll fix things between me and Meorys. We'll have a full crew, I'll handle this.\" He says with a determined look.","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:25:40.953000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866611745326235649","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Good. I don't like being forced to choose between you two. Especially since she's the one handling the essence for our ship.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:27:10.127000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866612119348445224","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"That is an extremely good point.\" The nameless then stands up, dusting his jacket as he does so. \"Actually, I think I should visit her right now and talk. I'll head over to her ship. You?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:29:11.495000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866612628402339880","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Sure. I've been planning on taking swim in the river now that I'm myself again but that can wait.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T09:29:37.073000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866612735684771860","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
