{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Oh and yesterday I had to fill my morning with water aerobics, there's a schedule I subscribed to, I can't break it\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:18:21.293000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869056019349766144","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"again she nods \"you've been busy'","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:18:44.720000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869056117609734175","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Anyways, um.. Are you busy right now? I feel like there's a lot to hear isn't there\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:19:16.793000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869056252133670973","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Not super busy at the moment\" She holds the door open for him \"We can chat\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:20:23.688000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869056532711632927","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"He steps in and adjusts his vest and coat. He orders his usual from the Café and sits down. He's given a hot chocolate with two individual trays of singular ice cubes that he likes to dip in his drink","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:21:38.841000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869056847926140938","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Sooo um, how was France?\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:22:09.541000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869056976691298315","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"For the most part, great. I was surprised how many people were willing to send supplies over.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:22:53.163000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869057159655227433","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"It really is easy to find the right people at the right time isn't it in this business?\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:23:30.977000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869057318258614323","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Very. There was this one lady who made her husband, some lord or whatever, to send their who private collection of weapons to Washington. He didn't like but I think she just wanted it out of their manor if I'm being honest.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:24:49.866000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869057649143054336","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I also found out you and El became friends\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:26:25.435000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869058049988513813","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Incredible! Spring cleaning and procurement all in one! Wait you know Eliza?\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:26:49.570000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869058151218024478","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"He sips on his hot chocolate and dips another half of an ice cube in","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:27:08.124000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869058229039169587","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"We were friends back in the day\" she nods","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:27:10.153000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869058237549408267","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"(you could say he's working on his ice Breakers 😉)","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:27:21.639000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869058285725184030","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Back when I would hop houses in the boroughs.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:27:54.791000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869058424774746184","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Oh I see. Where are you staying now? Eliza actually is part of the crew on my ship! She lives there too\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:29:09.935000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869058739951517766","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Wow Julie didn't tell you anything. She offered for me to stay there too\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:29:43.772000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869058881874190406","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I also met a good deal of your crew and Willow.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:30:02.331000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869058959716278272","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"She did!? I guess I'm not surprised, Julie adores you. But why keeping it from me will always be a mystery. I'm glad you've gotten acquainted\"\n\nHe shifts in his seat\n\"I take it you know we had been dating for the past two weeks or so?\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:31:36.473000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869059354576420864","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Oh I was comforting her after the break up happened\" She gives a small teasing smile","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:32:43.835000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-26T03:33:32.926000Z","id":"869059637113143367","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Ahhh of course you were. Well, it was an unfortunate ending but I think we'll both be better off for now as our own people. She's still part of my crew and has gained a lot of new responsibilities so I'm happy for her.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:34:45.352000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869060146792382474","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"She nods \"El also filled me in on all of that.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:35:24.450000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869060310781263933","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Only a few days in town and already have a reliable informant?\" he chuckles\n\"Oh you're good\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:35:54.368000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869060436266471504","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"She smiles","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:36:20.548000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869060546073342002","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I don't know what you're talking about\" she says sweetly","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:36:41.281000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869060633033850911","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Okay well you went over seas, you helped smuggle back supplies and make partnerships with the French to help Washington back here, why did you come back? I thought it'd at least be another decade before you returned to the colonies\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:37:40.935000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869060883240857621","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Well...\" She sighs \"I was great at getting supplies and allies, but it wasn't the same as being here.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:39:51.420000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869061430534615041","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I missed the city, which is odd cuz I never entirely made a home here.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:40:27.413000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869061581500207135","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"How long do you plan on staying? I could introduce you to some friends of mine, get you set up\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:41:51.895000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869061935843405824","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"As long as I can. I've been trying to get my footing again here but it has yet to happen. I was there with Nolan to talk to Mr. Smith, but I was no help so I left. Thankfully too, I heard it went down hill fast from there.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:44:12.390000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869062525122146314","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I've been spending most of my time in <#860473039098740766> \"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:44:40.328000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869062642302595112","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Unfortunately so, I arrived earlier this morning to see the aftermath. Luckily donuts were key to making a new friend there. Also I became a Lamplighter which is cool. I'm involved in a lot I realize\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:45:34.128000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869062867956170783","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"Oh that place is great! Eliza and I spent a lot of time shooting down there.\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:45:51.151000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869062939355795477","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"He begins counting off his fingers\n\"Captain of the patriot airforce, captain of the patriot forces here, manufacturing and supply, shipping, radio, news, weapon and armor supplying airship construction investor, and  I have hands in pockets to help fund the revolution completely\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:47:35.097000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869063375336923167","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"She nods along","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:48:26.368000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869063590383087647","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863371194371801118","content":"\"I also started scuba diving recently and underwater aerobics, who knew it could be so regenerative for the skin!\"","created_at":"2021-07-26T03:48:42.042000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869063656124596255","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
